+/*
+ * Offline http_access simulator (squid --simulate access.log).
+ *
+ * Replays access.log lines written with
+ *   logformat simulformat %tl %la %>a "%rm %ru HTTP/%rv" %>Hs %<st %Ss:%Sh
+ * (fields are read by position, so the logformat name does not matter)
+ * through the http_access rules of the parsed squid.conf and reports, for
+ * every request, the deciding rule and every other rule that also matches.
+ * No sockets are opened and nothing is forwarded.
+ *
+ * --sim-compare new.conf replays the same log through a second squid.conf
+ * and lists the requests whose verdict or deciding rule changes.
+ * --report out.html writes a self-contained HTML report.
+ *
+ * Included by main.cc only (single translation unit), so no build system
+ * changes are needed.
+ */
+
